units-session.ref:17	ref-heading	Levels
units-session.ref:21	ref-heading	The 50 records
units-session.ref:23	ref-heading	Level by level
units-session.ref:26	ref-para	The iron shield ($2C) is in the scripts of levels 3, 8, 14, 20. Rock rain is in those of 41, 43, 47, 50, 58.
units-session.ref:31	ref-para	The iron shield turns a shot back where it strikes.
units-session.ref:35	ref-para	No level places $06, $1A or $3C.
units-session.ref:39	ref-para	Level 50 has no empty cell.
units-session.ref:43	ref-para	9 slots hold $00.
units-session.ref:47	ref-para	Each card shows the level's room layout and the enemies its wave script can send.
units-session.ref:52	ref-para	A 2x2-character block, a 16x16-pixel tile.
units-session.ref:56	ref-para	A 2×2-character block, a 16×16-pixel tile.
units-session.ref:60	table-cell col=0	Table
units-session.ref:60	table-cell col=1	Record
