units-session.ref:74	table-cell col=1	A wall of any design
units-session.ref:77	ref-heading	Glossary
units-session.ref:80	term-title	Level index
units-session.ref:81	term-body	How far the player has got, 0 to 49. It wraps back to 0, so the level set repeats.
units-session.ref:84	term-title	Level index
units-session.ref:85	term-body	After the fiftieth level it wraps back to 0, so the level set repeats.
units-session.ref:87	term-title	Level index
units-session.ref:88	term-body	Which level is being played, counted from 0.
units-session.ref:90	term-title	Constants
units-session.ref:91	term-body	The names in operands. Each stands for one address or size.
units-session.ref:93	term-title	Redraw flag
units-session.ref:94	term-body	A flag on one screen cell saying its picture has changed since the screen was last drawn.
units-session.ref:97	term-title	Wall ($40–$7F)
units-session.ref:98	term-body	A block in the room that a bomb can break.
units-session.ref:100	ref-heading	Enemy speeds above 6
units-session.ref:101	ref-para	POKE 47904 ($BB20) with the new limit. The decimal is what the reader types.
units-session.ref:103	ref-heading	Tiles
units-session.ref:106	ref-para	Not a wall ($20–$3F, or $80 and up): passable. The tile map ($B200) holds codes.
units-session.ref:109	ref-heading	Siblings
units-session.ref:112	ref-para	IDs $20–$3F are passable.
units-session.ref:115	ref-para	Headings 0–3 move it 2 px left instead.
units-session.ref:118	ref-para	The headings sit 45° apart.
units-session.ref:121	ref-para	Test Y = sprite Y moved -2 px, upward.
units-session.ref:124	ref-para	The drone skips the speed limit. Nine of the 50 wave scripts carry it.
